    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that everything feels so incomplete. like i'm living in half a world. i look at my life and i just don't see a version of it where i'm actually happy again. it feels like the only way to actually stop this ache is to just be where he is. i know that sounds crazy but it's the only thing that feels like it would actually bring any peace.",
